# ─── MCP Transport ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
MCP_HTTP_PORT=8080
MCP_HTTP_HOST=0.0.0.0

# ─── Credentials ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This service reads Teramind credentials ONLY from request headers, never
# from the environment (SOP §3.1 — no env-var fallback). There is nothing to
# set here for auth. The two headers every /mcp request must carry:
#   X-Teramind-Instance:     <tenant>.teramind.co
#   X-Teramind-Access-Token: <access token from Teramind Administrator -> Access Tokens>
# For local testing with curl, export test values as shell variables instead
# of putting them in this file — see README "Local development".
